  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Home is a very important space in my life. When I move to a new place it takes time to become familiar. I am at my new home yet it feels unnatural and awkward to call it my sweet home. This is more so if you move from a small town to a big city or vice versa. This book captures and portrays that physical and emotional unbalance with personal images of Champaign (small town) and Chicago (big city)"--Artist's statement from website.</subfield>
